  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Diakonia Disability Rights Prog 15-21 - Diakonia CBR 15-20</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Diakonia Disability Rights Prog 15-21</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Diakonia har ans&#xf6;kt om fortsatt st&#xf6;d fr&#xe5;n Sida f&#xf6;r att implementera sitt program f&#xf6;r funktionshindrades r&#xe4;ttigheter i Palestina 2015-2020. Sida avser sluta avtal om de f&#xf6;rsta fyra &#xe5;ren.

Insatsens &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;l &#xe4;r att st&#xe4;rka m&#xe4;nniskor med funktionshinder s&#xe5; att de har &#xf6;kad tillg&#xe5;ng till och m&#xf6;jlighet att ut&#xf6;va sina politiska, sociala, kulturella och ekonomiska r&#xe4;ttigheter. Insatsen syftar till att &#xf6;ka integreringen av funktionshindrade i samh&#xe4;llet och deras tillg&#xe5;ng till h&#xe4;lsoservice, utbildning och arbetsm&#xf6;jligheter. Detta genomf&#xf6;rs genom att (i) implementera program som p&#xe5; lokal niv&#xe5; tillgodoser funktionhindrades r&#xe4;ttigheter, (ii) st&#xe4;rka m&#xe4;nniskor och organsiationer som arbetar f&#xf6;r m&#xe4;nniskor med funktionshinder att k&#xe4;nna till och kr&#xe4;va sina r&#xe4;ttigheter och (iii) genom att arbeta med relevanta ministerier och st&#xe4;rka deras kapacitet och f&#xf6;rm&#xe5;ga att tillgodose dessa r&#xe4;ttigheter. En viktig aspekt i programmet &#xe4;r d&#xe4;rmed kapacitetsutveckling av dessa akt&#xf6;rer. 

Kostnaden f&#xf6;r insatsen f&#xf6;r perioden 2015-2018 uppg&#xe5;r till SEK 48 000 000. Norad/NAD bidrar med SEK 20 000 000 medan Sida bidrar med SEK 28 000 000. Dessutom bidrar EU med 
SEK 10 831 300 f&#xf6;r det specifika programmet i &#xf6;stra Jerusalem 2015-2017.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Diakonia has applied for continued support from Sida to implement its&apos; Disability rights programme in Palestine 2015-2020. Sida will sign an agreement for the first four years. 

The overall goal of the programme is to empower people with disabilities so that they have greater access to and the ability to exercise their political, social, cultural and economic rights. The intervention aims to increase the integration of disable people in society and their access to health services, education and employment opportunities. This is accomplished by (i) implement programs at the local level that responds to the needs of people with disabilities, (ii) strengthening people and organisations which are working for people with disabilities to know and demand their rights, and (iii) working with relevant ministries and strengthen their capacity and ability to meet these rights. An important aspect of the program is therefore capacity development of these players.

 The cost of the intervention for the period 2015-2018 amounts to SEK 48 000 000. Norad/NAD contribute with SEK 20 000 000 while Sida contributes with SEK 28 000 000. In addition, EU
 contributes with SEK 10,831,300 for the specific program in East Jerusalem from 2015 to 2017.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">People with disabilities are empowered and have improved access to and ability to exert their political, social, cultural and economic rights.</narrative>
  </description>
